{"home_guards(jap)" "This squad of 16 banzai chargers, all troops being skill 1, is only lightly armed and minimally trained. With only bolt-action rifles and a few grenades, they are not equipped for serious combat. However, you may find them useful in defensive roles and for securing ground you've taken. Under the right conditions, and with proper support, they can be an effective fighting force worthy of the Homeland."}
{"smgs(jap)" "A squad of 15 troops with 2 skill, armed with rifles and submachine guns. These infantrymen are equipped to assault enemy positions. Their loadout also makes them ideal for close-quarter combat and urban fighting. They lack machine guns for suppressive fire, so it may be important to provide some additional fire support to cover their advance."}
{"riflemans(jap)" "This squad of 15 soldiers with 2 skill are a balanced fighting force that combines rifles and other small arms, along with a light machine gun, to provide fire support. While they are equipped with the firepower necessary to advance upon the enemy, you may find that they are better served in a defensive role. The machine gun can suppress and splinter enemy infantry formations, while riflemen pick off their targets. This squad provides a solid backbone for any fighting force."}
{"stormtroopers(jap)" "SNLF assault detachment with two Type 99 LMGs, Type 100 SMGs, rifles and a Type 4 AT launcher. Notably high stamina."}
{"ap_miners(jap)" "Anti-personnel mining team for area denial and flank security."}
{"at_miners(jap)" "Anti-tank mining team to block routes and channel enemy armor."}
{"officers(jap)" "This experienced field officer is capable of supporting your troops by spotting enemy units from afar with his binoculars. Use his skill in locating enemy units through the fog of war, so that your other units can engage or avoid them as necessary. The officer also reduces your current CP by 20 which allows you to field a bigger army."}
; new
{"hero_jap_guard(jap)" "This squad of 15 Konoe Shidan comes with 2 RPGs, 2 MGs, and 2 rifle grenadiers alongside 8 riflemen and SMG troops, all skill 5. They are perfectly trained to be a defensive fighting force, fortifying your lines while other units take on the offensive against the enemy."}
{"home_guards_throwgun(jap)" "This squad of 16 banzai chargers, all troops being skill 1, armed with ai friendly grenades and melee weapons. Best set to free move."}
